  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "数百万怪物席卷数十关，导弹、火炮与激光同时铺满战场追求极端火力",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Hordes of monsters crash down on you, exploding into crimson mist with every shot. Missiles rain, cannons roar, and lasers paint the sky! Unleash extreme firepower to incinerate every enemy in your path. Millions of monstrosities across dozens of levels eye you hungrily.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "被怪群包围或弹药紧缺时可呼叫Titan Mecha，以重装火力直接碾过Boss和精英",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Surrounded by monsters? Running low on ammo? Your Titan Mechas are always on standby, ready to deploy. With a brutal aesthetic and overwhelming firepower, they'll crush everything in their path. Bosses or elite foes? They're just minor speed bumps on your rampage.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每套Power Armor都有专属升级，芯片与三百多项强化还能合成终极装备",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each Power Armor boasts unique upgrades—there's always one to suit your playstyle. A vast arsenal of chips will supercharge your combat, combining with over 300 upgrades to maximize the adrenaline rush of every encounter. Mix and match diverse auxiliary equipment to create unique experiences each run, and even synthesize ultimate gear to utterly dominate the battlefield!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
